sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    participant User as User
    participant Browser as Browser(Next Client)
    participant NextS as Next Server(API Routes)
    participant AS as Auth Server
    participant SS as Spring Security
    participant SAS as Spring Authorization Server
    participant Nimbus as Nimbus(JWT)
    participant RS as Resource Server

    Note over NextS: PKCE(verifier→challenge), state, nonceを生成<br/>Cookie(httpOnly)へ保存

    User ->> Browser: ログインボタンクリック

    %% --- 認可リクエスト ---
    Browser ->> AS: GET /oauth2/authorize (client_id...nonce, state)

    %% --- Auth Server：ログインチェック ---
    AS ->> SS: 認証済みか？
    SS -->> AS: 未ログイン

    SS ->> User: 自動生成ログイン画面
    User ->> SS: POST /login (ID/PW)
    SS ->> SS: UserDetails照合
    SS -->> AS: 認証成功

    SS ->> AS: SavedRequest復元 → /oauth2/authorize へ戻す
    Browser ->> AS: GET /oauth2/authorize (再)

    %% --- SAS：認可処理 ---
    AS ->> SAS: 認可リクエスト検証(client_id, redirect_uri, scope)
    SAS ->> SAS: 認可コード生成
    SAS ->> SAS: 認可データ保存(OAuth2AuthorizationService)
    SAS -->> Browser: 302 redirect_uri?code=AUTH_CODE&state=STATE

    %% --- Next Callback ---
    Browser ->> NextS: GET /callback (code, state)
    NextS ->> NextS: state検証
    NextS ->> AS: POST /oauth2/token (code + code_verifier)
    
    AS ->> SAS: 認可コード検証(PKCE一致, redirect_uri一致)
    SAS ->> SAS: AccessToken/IDToken クレーム構築
    SAS ->> Nimbus: RS256署名依頼
    Nimbus -->> SAS: 署名済みJWT
    SAS -->> NextS: access_token + id_token

    NextS ->> Browser: Tokenを返す(JSON)
    Browser ->> Browser: sessionStorageに保存

    %% --- ユーザーがSampleページへ ---
    User ->> Browser: /sample ページへ移動

    %% --- ① public API ---
    User ->> Browser: 「① /public」クリック
    Browser ->> RS: GET /public
    RS -->> Browser: Public応答

    %% --- ② private/tokenなし ---
    User ->> Browser: 「② /private tokenなし」クリック
    Browser ->> RS: GET /private
    RS -->> Browser: 401 Unauthorized

    %% --- ③ private/tokenあり ---
    User ->> Browser: 「③ /private tokenあり」クリック
    Browser ->> RS: GET /private (Authorization: Bearer access_token)
    RS ->> AS: GET /oauth2/jwks
    AS -->> RS: JWK Set
    RS ->> RS: AccessToken検証
    RS -->> Browser: Private成功レスポンス

    %% --- ④ ID Token 検証 ---
    User ->> Browser: 「④ IDトークン検証」クリック
    Browser ->> NextS: POST /api/auth/verify (id_token)
    NextS ->> AS: GET /oauth2/jwks
    AS -->> NextS: JWK Set
    NextS ->> NextS: RS256署名検証 + iss/aud/exp検証
    NextS ->> NextS: nonce検証(id_token.nonce == cookie.nonce)

    NextS -->> Browser: header + payload (署名・nonce一致)
